#describe what The Plans strip shows at most five chips of unfinished plans; More N opens the rest and Done N opens finished plans.
#describe before Every plan was a chip in the strip, and a long list of plans overflowed it.
#describe after Five chips, then More N and Done N, each opening a popover list; picking a plan opens it in the Planning view.
#describe verified typecheck, lint and the full test suite pass; the new test file fails on the old strip.
