#reason test/lantern-plan-strip-done.test.ts Proves five chips and a More list, finished plans leaving the strip, lists opening and closing, and a pick opening the plan.
#reason skills/lantern-plan/scripts/messages.json Adds the More and Done controls' labels, tooltips and list headings as view messages, as the catalogue rule requires.
#reason src/renderer/lantern-plans.css Styles the More and Done controls and their lists so they match the strip's chips.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternplanstrip.ts Keeps the strip short: five chips, a More list for the rest and a Done list for finished plans, one shared popover helper.
#story Finding an unfinished plan in a long list
#step actor A person with many plans
#step action opens the Plans strip
#file src/renderer/lib/lanternplanstrip.ts
#step subject the list of plans
#below interaction Sees five plans in progress, plus More and Done counts
#below consequence Every plan, done or not, filled and overflowed the strip => Finished plans wait behind one Done control
#story Opening a finished plan
#step actor A person
#step action presses Done and picks a plan
#file test/lantern-plan-strip-done.test.ts
#step subject the finished plan
#below interaction Reads it in the Planning view, as with any chip
